Licensing notice

This repository contains the educational starter from
VinUni-AI20k/K5-L3B-LAB-Day12-AI-SDLC and team ABC's lab contributions.
The inherited starter did not include an explicit license at the baseline used
for this release. This notice does not grant rights over that upstream work.
Contact the upstream author before redistribution outside the course.

The game has no bundled third-party artwork, fonts, music or sound effects.
The browser uses system fonts and shapes drawn by the project's own code.
Playwright is an optional development dependency (Apache-2.0), not vendored in
the release archive. Chromium is installed separately through Playwright and
retains its own third-party notices and licenses.
